Causes of this could be from either heavy fragmentation on the AdvFS
domain, or missing bootblocks on the disk. In the former case,
defragment; in the latter, re-write the bootblocks via disklabel (-t
advfs, etc).

> The filesystem is ADFS.

AdvFS :-)

