You probably miss the osf-usr license or have forgotten to remove the
implicit one:


darcy /# lmf list for osf-usr
Product                   Status                     Users: Total      Active

OSF-USR                   active                            4          0    
OSF-USR                   active, multiple                  4          0    

darcy /# lmf list full for osf-usr
           Product Name: OSF-USR
               Producer: DEC
                 Issuer: DEC
   Authorization Number: UNIX-SERVER-IMPLICIT-USER

<bla bla bla>

darcy /# lmf delete osf-usr dec UNIX-SERVER-IMPLICIT-USER
darcy /# lmf reset
darcy /# lmf list for osf-usr
Product                   Status                     Users: Total      Active
OSF-USR                   active                            unlimited

Kjell



